  "created": "2021-07-22T00:18:49.977Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I'd like to suggest a simple LOD system for avatars at a distance. We could have a setting that can be adjusted where at a certain distance away it'll show the avatar's quest option. It could be useful for performance to only show quest avatars from far away and only display the full pc avatar on coming in closer. Wouldn't even require any adjustments from the player base.",
